{"version":1,"key":"card:6","content":{"id":6,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过索引类型定义接口的键值需要符合的约束"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"interface Something {\n  // 这个 key 可以随便写成什么有语义的东西\n  [key: string]: string;\n  // [fieldName: string]: string;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f77b8a80-144e-4143-bf6c-40e0fcfbc854","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面定义了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Something","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的键必须为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，值也必须为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型。不过因为 JavaScript 通过数字索引去访问属性时，会被转换为字符串，因此此时键是数字可以可以的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// ✅\nconst something: Something = {\n  name: 'John',\n  1: \"2\",\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8983f749-3820-4080-a918-f342c275d97f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// ❎\nconst something2: Something = {\n  age: 30,\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"fcecf5a7-8153-4791-9fd3-27b57e0a67f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.2mzv9h44pho0.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.2mzv9h44pho0.png","width":698},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以同时存在索引形式和具体形式的键值定义，但是"},{"type":"formatted","text":"具体形式的键值定义必须符合索引形式的定义","bold":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// name: string 符合 [fieldName: string]: string ✅\ninterface SomeType {\n  [fieldName: string]: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n// isValid: boolean，boolean 不符合索引形式定义的值都为 string，❎\ninterface SomeType2 {\n  [fieldName: string]: string;\n  isValid: boolean;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"ab019d3e-47cb-46c1-a1ff-f6d50a09dd94","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.5gpcmqs0bh00.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.5gpcmqs0bh00.png","width":698},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["TypeScript/索引"],"createTime":1688911558991,"updateTime":1763340298208,"linkedCards":[{"id":4,"target":{"key":"card:4","type":"card","id":4},"summary":"通过索引我们可以查询键对应的值的类型，这个索引查询不是作用在 JavaScript 对象上，可以作用在类型上，比如接口 interface Obj { a: string; b: number; 1: string; } type A = ...","tags":["TypeScript/索引查询"]},{"id":140,"target":{"key":"card:140","type":"card","id":140},"summary":"通过索引，可以批量定义键值对 interface Obj { [key: string]: number; } 但如果我只允许存在有限的键，比如该接口只包含几个属性，但是我又不想一一定义，有什么办法，可以使用映射类型进行循环，如 inter...","tags":["TypeScript/类型操作"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763340298208}}